{"seq":2,"slug":"sampling-strategy-engineering","title":"头部采样与尾采样策略工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/observability-tracing-telemetry-platform/tracing-instrumentation-propagation/sampling-strategy-engineering","wordCount":2666,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"头部采样与尾采样策略工程\">头部采样与尾采样策略工程</h1><p>一个大促日凌晨，跨境结算链路每秒打进 4 万条 trace。全量留存意味着每天数十 TB 的 span 数据与一笔与业务毛利不成比例的观测账单；但简单砍到 1%，那条因境外 PSP 超时导致订单失败的链路、那条因新上线灰度服务引入额外 800ms 的链路，恰恰最容易落在被丢弃的 99% 里。采样工程要回答的不是&quot;留多少&quot;，而是<strong>在哪个环节、依据什么信息、用多大的确定性代价</strong>做出留或弃的决定。头部采样在请求还没跑完时就下注，尾采样等整条 trace 装配完毕后再裁决，二者的取舍与协同构成观测成本与可排障性的核心张力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-决策时点决定了你能看到什么\">核心概念：决策时点决定了你能看到什么</h2><p>采样（sampling）在 OpenTelemetry 语境里只有一个含义：被采样的 span/trace 会被处理并导出，未被采样的不被处理、不被导出（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/sampling/\">OpenTelemetry Sampling</a>）。区分策略的不是概率高低，而是<strong>决策发生在 trace 生命周期的哪个时点</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>头部采样（head sampling）</strong>：在请求最早的时刻、整条 trace 尚未成型时决定。它只能基于<strong>当下已知的信息</strong>——通常是 trace-id 的随机性，或父级传播下来的采样标志。优点是实现简单、开销极低、可放在采集流水线任意位置；根本局限是<strong>无法保证留下后来才出现错误或高延迟的 trace</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>尾采样（tail sampling）</strong>：在收集器（collector）侧缓冲整条 trace 的所有 span，等大多数 span 到齐后再依据<strong>完整信息</strong>裁决：任意 span 是否报错、端到端延迟、某个属性的取值。它表达力强，代价是有状态的收集器要在内存里持有大量 trace 数据。\n两者的分工可用一张决策时点图说清：</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[请求进入边缘网关] --&gt; B{头部采样决策&lt;br/&gt;仅凭 trace-id 随机性}&#10;    B --&gt;|采样标志=0| C[SDK 丢弃&lt;br/&gt;后续 span 不再导出]&#10;    B --&gt;|采样标志=1| D[注入 traceparent&lt;br/&gt;传播 sampled 标志]&#10;    D --&gt; E[跨服务传播&lt;br/&gt;各服务继承父决策]&#10;    E --&gt; F[收集器缓冲整条 trace&lt;br/&gt;decision_wait 窗口]&#10;    F --&gt; G{尾采样复合策略裁决}&#10;    G --&gt;|命中 error/latency&lt;br/&gt;或按比例| H[导出到后端]&#10;    G --&gt;|未命中| I[内存释放丢弃]&#10;    C --&gt; J[高风险: 错误 trace 被漏掉]\">graph TD\n    A[请求进入边缘网关] --&gt; B{头部采样决策&lt;br/&gt;仅凭 trace-id 随机性}\n    B --&gt;|采样标志=0| C[SDK 丢弃&lt;br/&gt;后续 span 不再导出]\n    B --&gt;|采样标志=1| D[注入 traceparent&lt;br/&gt;传播 sampled 标志]\n    D --&gt; E[跨服务传播&lt;br/&gt;各服务继承父决策]\n    E --&gt; F[收集器缓冲整条 trace&lt;br/&gt;decision_wait 窗口]\n    F --&gt; G{尾采样复合策略裁决}\n    G --&gt;|命中 error/latency&lt;br/&gt;或按比例| H[导出到后端]\n    G --&gt;|未命中| I[内存释放丢弃]\n    C --&gt; J[高风险: 错误 trace 被漏掉]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>头部采样</th>\n<th>尾采样</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>决策时点</td>\n<td>trace 未完成时</td>\n<td>缓冲区窗口结束后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用信息</td>\n<td>trace-id 随机性、父决策</td>\n<td>全部 span 的属性、状态码、时长、span 数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态</td>\n<td>无状态</td>\n<td>有状态，需按 trace-id 聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型组件</td>\n<td>SDK sampler</td>\n<td>Collector tail_sampling processor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存代价</td>\n<td>可忽略</td>\n<td>每实例持有 num_traces 条 trace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能否保证留下错误 trace</td>\n<td>不能</td>\n<td>能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个关键约束是：<strong>头部采样丢弃的 span 不会再回来</strong>。一旦 <code>sampled=0</code>，SDK 会记下这个标志并向所有子 span 传播，收集器根本收不到这条 trace，尾采样无从补救。所以二者的关系不是&quot;二选一&quot;，而是<strong>级联</strong>——头部先降压，尾采样再做精细裁决，否则尾采样层会被全量数据击穿。\n| 部署约束 | 任意位置 | 同一 trace 必须落到同一实例 |</p>\n<h2 id=\"头部采样-确定性与父子一致性\">头部采样：确定性与父子一致性</h2><p>头部采样的核心实现是<strong>一致性概率采样</strong>（consistent probability sampling，又称确定性采样）：决策由 trace-id 派生，因此同一条 trace 在任何时间、任何子 span 上得到相同答案。规范里 <code>TraceIdRatioBased</code> 要求对 trace-id 做确定性哈希，且<strong>更高概率的采样器必须涵盖更低概率采样器所采样的每一条 trace</strong>——这个&quot;嵌套子集&quot;性质是后续用调整计数做统计外推的前提（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otel/trace/sdk/\">OpenTelemetry Trace SDK</a>）。</p>\n<p>裸的比例采样器会无视父级决策，造成同一 trace 在不同服务上判断不一致。解决办法是 <strong><code>ParentBased</code> 装饰器</strong>：按父级是否存在、是否远程、是否已采样分派到不同委派采样器。默认整体采样器是 <code>ParentBased(root=AlwaysOn)</code>，五路分派规则如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>父状态</th>\n<th>远程</th>\n<th>已采样</th>\n<th>委派给</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不存在</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code>root()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存在</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>remoteParentSampled()</code>（默认 AlwaysOn）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存在</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><code>remoteParentNotSampled()</code>（默认 AlwaysOff）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存在</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>localParentSampled()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存在</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><code>localParentNotSampled()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套设计的工程含义是：<strong>只要根 span 做了决定，整条 trace 就跟随该决定</strong>，不会出现上半链采样、下半链丢弃导致的&quot;半截 trace&quot;。</p>\n<p>更现代的做法是 OTel 正在推进的 <code>ProbabilitySampler</code> / 可组合采样器，它实现 W3C Trace Context Level 2 的一致性概率采样，用 56 位随机性（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otel/trace/tracestate-probability-sampling/\">OTel Probability Sampling</a>）。规则很简洁：把概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 转成拒绝阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>56</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = (1 - p) \\times 2^{56}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">56</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，随机值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 取 trace-id 最右侧 7 字节（或显式携带的 TraceState <code>rv</code> 值），当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\geq T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 时保留该 span。阈值写进 TraceState 的 <code>th</code> 键——1% 采样记为 <code>th:fd70a4</code>，100% 记为 <code>th:0</code>。由于所有参与者共享同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，跨服务、跨流水线阶段的决策天然嵌套一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"尾采样-复合策略与内存的真实代价\">尾采样：复合策略与内存的真实代价</h2><p>尾采样在 OpenTelemetry Collector 中由 <code>tail_sampling</code> processor 实现：一组<strong>可组合策略（policy）</strong>，任一策略投票保留则整条 trace 保留。主要类型包括（<a href=\"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib/blob/main/processor/tailsamplingprocessor/README.md\">tail_sampling processor</a>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>latency</code>：按 trace 时长（最早 span 起点到最晚 span 终点）判定，支持下界与可选上界；</li>\n<li><code>status_code</code>：匹配 <code>OK</code> / <code>ERROR</code> / <code>UNSET</code>；</li>\n<li><code>numeric_attribute</code> / <code>string_attribute</code> / <code>boolean_attribute</code>：按资源或 span 属性取值匹配；<code>span_count</code> 按 span 数上下界匹配；</li>\n<li><code>probabilistic</code>：按百分比随机，默认用 FNV-1a 哈希加 <code>hash_salt</code>；<code>rate_limiting</code> 用令牌桶限制每秒 span 数，可配突发容量；</li>\n<li><code>and</code> / <code>composite</code>：组合子策略，后者支持按比例分配保留额度；<code>ottl_condition</code> 用 OTTL 表达式做布尔判断。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三个默认参数必须先吃透：<code>decision_wait</code> 默认 <strong>30 秒</strong>（等待 span 到齐的窗口），<code>num_traces</code> 默认 <strong>50000</strong>（内存中同时持有的 trace 数），<code>expected_new_traces_per_sec</code> 默认 0。</p>\n<p>失败模式很具体：若每秒新进 trace 数乘以 <code>decision_wait</code> 超过 <code>num_traces</code>，<strong>最老的 trace 会在做出决定前被驱逐</strong>，计入 <code>otelcol_processor_tail_sampling_sampling_trace_dropped_too_early</code>。调大 <code>num_traces</code> 能降低早丢，代价是内存线性上升。所需并存规模粗算为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\approx \\lambda \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 为每秒新 trace 数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为 <code>decision_wait</code> 秒数）；以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 40000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40000</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = 30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 计，理论上要同时持有 120 万条 trace 才能避免早丢——远超单实例能力，正是 OTel 警告尾采样可能&quot;需要数十甚至上百个计算节点&quot;的原因。\n一个部署硬约束常被忽视：<strong>同一条 trace 的所有 span 必须到达同一个收集器实例</strong>，否则每个实例只看到片段，会各自做出不自洽的裁决。正确拓扑是<strong>两层</strong>——前置一层用 load-balancing exporter 按 trace-id 做一致性哈希，后置一层专门跑尾采样；官方建议拆两层以获得更好的故障隔离。此外尾采样必须放在 <code>k8sattributes</code> 这类依赖上下文的处理器<strong>之后</strong>，因为它会重组 span 批次、丢弃上下文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"头尾协同-调整计数与-span-to-metrics\">头尾协同：调整计数与 span-to-metrics</h2><p>头尾级联的真正价值，在于让&quot;留下的样本&quot;仍能<strong>无偏代表被丢弃的流量</strong>。这依赖一致性概率采样中的<strong>调整计数</strong>（adjusted count）：一个被保留的 span 实际代表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 条原始数据，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>adjusted count</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>p</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>56</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>56</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{adjusted count} = \\frac{1}{p} = \\frac{2^{56}}{2^{56} - T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">adjusted count</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2604em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">56</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">56</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>假设头部以 1% 概率采样、尾采样对错误 trace 全部保留。没有调整计数时错误率会被严重高估——分母只统计了被采样的那 1%。有它之后，每个 span 带着自己的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>（即权重），后端聚合时用调整计数加权，就能从 1% 的样本估出真实的全量错误率与 P99 延迟。这正是&quot;用 1% 或更低采样率准确代表剩余流量&quot;在统计上成立的前提（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/sampling/\">OpenTelemetry Sampling</a>）。</p>\n<p>协同的分工：头部采样确定<strong>这条 trace 的基础概率</strong>，尾采样只能在此基础上<strong>提高阈值（即降低概率）</strong>——被头部丢掉的 span 已不存在。规范明确下游采样器可抬高阈值但不能降低，保证尾采样只是在头部样本中<strong>选出协调一致的子集</strong>，不破坏统计有效性。推荐形态是 <strong>SDK 头部先按 trace-id 做一致性概率采样，收集器尾采样再叠加 latency / status_code 规则</strong>——前者把数据量压到很低基数，后者的处理器虽重但已不会过载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境电商链路的落地取舍\">跨境电商链路的落地取舍</h2><p>第一，<strong>成本门槛要先量化再决定是否上采样</strong>。OTel 经验值：每秒 1000 条以上 trace 时考虑采样，高流量系统里 1% 甚至更低足以代表流量；每秒几十条小 trace 时采样可能没必要（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/sampling/\">OpenTelemetry Sampling</a>）。官方还提醒三种情况应避免或限制采样：数据可预聚合、法规禁止丢弃数据、观测预算比工程复杂度更便宜。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>采样策略必须与合规边界绑定</strong>。跨境链路的 <code>tracestate</code>、Baggage 可能携带用户标识；采样策略应把<strong>含敏感属性的 span 纳入强制保留或强制丢弃的白名单</strong>，而非交给随机概率——一条含 PII 的链路是否落到境外后端存储，是合规决定，不是概率决定。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>保证&quot;黄金信号 trace&quot;永不丢失</strong>。对结算、支付、清关等关键路径，用尾采样的 <code>status_code=ERROR</code> + <code>numeric_attribute</code>（如 <code>http.status_code &gt;= 500</code>）+ <code>latency</code> 组合强制保留；其余流量用 <code>probabilistic</code> 或 <code>rate_limiting</code> 限流，防止大促洪峰冲垮尾采样层。<code>rate_limiting</code> 的令牌桶是<strong>过载保护</strong>，而非采样策略。</p>\n<p>第四，<strong>必须监控采样系统自身</strong>。OTel 明确要求尾采样&quot;必须被监控以确保资源充足&quot;，核心指标包括 <code>sampling_trace_dropped_too_early</code>（早丢）、决策缓存命中率与内存中持有的 trace 数。早丢持续大于 0 说明 <code>num_traces</code> 或节点数不足——不是策略设计错，而是资源撑不住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>采样工程的本质，是<strong>在信息量与成本之间选择下注时点</strong>。要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>头部采样在 trace 未成型时决策，只能依据 trace-id 随机性与父决策；无法保证留下后来才出错或变慢的 trace。</li>\n<li><code>ParentBased</code> 装饰器让整条 trace 跟随根 span 的决定，避免&quot;半截 trace&quot;；五路分派规则（根 / 远程 / 本地 × 是否采样）是配置核心。</li>\n<li>一致性概率采样把概率转成阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>56</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=(1-p)\\times 2^{56}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">56</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用共享随机值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\geq T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 判定，通过 TraceState <code>th</code> / <code>rv</code> 传播，使决策天然嵌套。</li>\n<li>尾采样用 <code>latency</code> / <code>status_code</code> / <code>attribute</code> / <code>probabilistic</code> / <code>rate_limiting</code> 等可组合策略裁决；<code>decision_wait</code>（默认 30s）、<code>num_traces</code>（默认 50000）决定内存与早丢率，并存规模约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>同一 trace 必须落到同一收集器实例，需用 load-balancing exporter 前置分层；尾采样器自身必须被监控。</li>\n<li>调整计数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 让 1% 样本无偏外推全量错误率与延迟，是头尾级联统计成立的前提；下游只能抬高阈值，不能降低。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些机制承接 <a href=\"trace-context-propagation\">追踪上下文传播与 W3C TraceContext 模型</a>：上下文让 trace-id 在链路上保持诚实，采样决定这条链路有多少能活着抵达后端。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"头部采样与尾采样策略工程","id":"头部采样与尾采样策略工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：决策时点决定了你能看到什么","id":"核心概念-决策时点决定了你能看到什么"},{"level":2,"text":"头部采样：确定性与父子一致性","id":"头部采样-确定性与父子一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"尾采样：复合策略与内存的真实代价","id":"尾采样-复合策略与内存的真实代价"},{"level":2,"text":"头尾协同：调整计数与 span-to-metrics","id":"头尾协同-调整计数与-span-to-metrics"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商链路的落地取舍","id":"跨境电商链路的落地取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"追踪上下文传播与 W3C TraceContext 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/observability-tracing-telemetry-platform/tracing-instrumentation-propagation/trace-context-propagation"},"next":{"title":"自动埋点与 OpenTelemetry SDK 接入实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/observability-tracing-telemetry-platform/tracing-instrumentation-propagation/auto-instrumentation-otel-sdk"}}